		"title": "A constructor nothing calls, under --gc-sections",
		"kind": "object",
		"command": "ld --gc-sections -o prog a.o",
		"request": "a.o: a _start in .text._start, a ctor in .text.ctor that nothing calls, and an .init_array whose single entry is relocated to ctor",
		"request_hex": "",
		"response": "Both .init_array and ctor are in the output, and nothing else is dropped either",
